WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.681
Some leaders run institutions. Dr. Lalit Kumar Wadhwa

1.2
00:00:03.681 --> 00:00:06.912
builds them, and helps them earn their rankings.

2.1
00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:11.749
He is Director of IQAC at Vishwakarma University,

2.2
00:00:11.749 --> 00:00:15.381
Pune, with a PhD from IIT (ISM) Dhanbad.

3
00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:24.022
26 years in higher education. Two principalships. 60+ publications, six books, and seven patents.

4.1
00:00:25.217 --> 00:00:30.700
From a lecturer in 2000, to Dean, to Principal twice, then Director

4.2
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:36.183
of Innovation and Ranking, Director of Academics, and now, Director of Quality Assurance.

5.1
00:00:37.383 --> 00:00:41.983
He works fluently across every framework that matters. NBA,

5.2
00:00:41.983 --> 00:00:46.583
NAAC, NIRF, Times Higher Education, QS, and NEP 2020.

6.1
00:00:47.783 --> 00:00:51.615
His approach is simple. Diagnose. Plan. Build. Submit. And

6.2
00:00:51.615 --> 00:00:55.447
sustain, so every gain carries into the next cycle.

7.1
00:00:56.650 --> 00:01:00.231
And the results speak. The Singapore Educational Excellence

7.2
00:01:00.231 --> 00:01:03.811
Award, and two institutions lifted to IIC 3-Star.

8
00:01:05.017 --> 00:01:09.359
Ready to take your university to the next level? Let's build excellence together.
